      "episode": 7,
      "number": 7,
      "released": "2023-07-23T00:00:01.000Z",
      "overview": "After the reception event, Abeer and Hannan decide to befriend each other. Hannan meets Sara at the university. She asks him if he would leave his wife for her. At home, Abeer finds a text from Sara on Hannan's mobile.",
